msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "Welcome to &kde;!"
msgstr "Dobrodošli u &kde;!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This guide will introduce you to the many features of the &kde-sc; and "
"describe many common tasks you can perform in all &kde; applications."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj vodič će vas upoznati sa mnogim karakteristikama &kde-sc;; i opisati "
"mnoge zajedničke zadatke možete izvoditi u svim &kde; aplikacijama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For more information on &kde;, visit the <ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org/"
"\">KDE website</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Za više informacija o &kde;, posjetite <ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org/"
"\">KDE web stranicu</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Credits and License"
msgstr "Zasluge i licenca"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The original idea for this guide was proposed by Chusslove Illich and "
"brought to fruition with input from &Burkhard.Lueck;, Yuri Chornoivan, and "
"&TC.Hollingsworth;"
msgstr ""
"Prvobitnu ideju za ovaj vodič je predložio Chusslove Illich a to je urodilo "
"plodom uz doprinos Burkhard.Lueck;, Yuri Chornoivan, i &TC.Hollingsworth;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Much of it was written by participants of <ulink url=\"http://code.google."
"com/opensource/gci/2011-12/index.html\">Google Code-In 2011</ulink>. Thanks "
"to Google for sponsoring their excellent work!"
msgstr ""
"Veliki dio su napisali učesnici <ulink url = \"http://code.google.com/"
"opensource/gci/2011-12/index.html\">Google Code-In 2011 </ulink>. Zahvale "
"Google-u za sponzoriranje njihovog odličnog posla!"

